This project is built zoneless — hence signals in the templates instead of mutable fields.

```ts
const cdr = inject(ChangeDetectorRef);

cdr.markForCheck();    // “check me and my ancestors in the next cycle” — asynchronous
cdr.detectChanges();   // “check this subtree right now” — synchronous

cdr.detach();          // disconnect the component from automatic checks
cdr.reattach();

// the typical use of detectChanges: data arrived outside Angular's zone
zone.runOutsideAngular(() => {
  socket.onmessage = (e) => {
    this.data = JSON.parse(e.data);
    zone.run(() => cdr.detectChanges());
  };
});
